plugin_name: Kimi Translator
plugin_description: Uses the Kimi (Moonshot AI) Chat API for translation. You need to provide your own API Key.

kimi_reg_url: API Key URL
kimi_reg_url_summary: Create and manage your API Key here: https://platform.kimi.com/console/api-keys

kimi_github: GitHub
kimi_github_summary: https://github.com/ZZPBY/MT-KimiTranslationEngine

kimi_api_key_summary: Kimi (Moonshot AI) API Key
kimi_api_key_empty: API Key is empty. Please set your API Key in plugin settings.
kimi_api_key: API Key

kimi_model: Model
kimi_model_hint: Enter the model name
kimi_model_summary: Custom model name, for example kimi-k3, kimi-k2.6
kimi_model_empty: Model is empty. Please set the model name in plugin settings.

kimi_temperature: Temperature
kimi_temperature_hint: 0 to 2, leave empty for model default
kimi_temperature_summary: Leave empty to omit the temperature parameter and use the model default

kimi_test_title: Translation Test
kimi_test_summary: Fill in API Key and model, then click to verify availability
kimi_test_loading: Testing...
kimi_test_success: Test succeeded, translation result: 
kimi_test_failed: Test failed: 
kimi_test_empty_result: Test failed: Empty translation result
